{
 "language": "en",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 6.5,
   "text": "Hey everybody forget the burgers forget the fries tonight we're making Persian"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.5,
   "end": 14.22,
   "text": "chicken paradise get your saffron grab your skewers let's make some jiu-jitsu"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.22,
   "end": 23.56,
   "text": "kebab. Two pounds of chicken cut into squares. Boneless thighs or breasts nobody"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.56,
   "end": 32.76,
   "text": "cares. Two onions sliced. Let the flavor flow. Add some yogurt. If you like it"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.76,
   "end": 39.74,
   "text": "slow. Fresh lemon juice, a little lime. Olive oil to make it shine. Salt and"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 47.04,
   "text": "pepper just a pinch turmeric too for a golden finish but wait a minute here's the key saffron"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.04,
   "end": 53.16,
   "text": "water strong and free crush those threads at water hot that's the magic that's the spy"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.16,
   "end": 61.94,
   "text": "juje juje golden chicken come my way saffron shiny lemon bright Persian chicken done just right"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.94,
   "end": 69.72,
   "text": "juje juje let it marinate away on the fire smell that heat nothing beats this"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.26,
   "end": 75.7,
   "text": "Mix it up and coat each piece Let the flavors have their peace"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.28,
   "end": 80.18,
   "text": "Cover tight and chill all night For hours minimum works just right"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.18,
   "end": 84.86,
   "text": "Don't rust the chicken, let it rest That's how you make the very best before"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.86,
   "end": 87.98,
   "text": "the grill Shake off the sauce, too much marinade"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.98,
   "end": 91.38,
   "text": "can cause a loss Take your skewers, slide them through"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.38,
   "end": 95.96,
   "text": "Leave a little space between each cube Keep the pieces even in size"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.96,
   "end": 98.34,
   "text": "That's how you get that perfect prize"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.34,
   "end": 100.48,
   "text": "Choco glowin' flames are low"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.48,
   "end": 102.7,
   "text": "Place the chicken, let it go"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.7,
   "end": 105.12,
   "text": "Turn it off then nice and slow"
  },
  {
   "start": 105.12,
   "end": 107.34,
   "text": "Golden edges, start to show"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.34,
   "end": 109.2,
   "text": "Brush with butter, saffron"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.2,
   "end": 111.66,
   "text": "Two lemon butter, comin' through"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.66,
   "end": 113.66,
   "text": "Cookin' fully, don't guess the time"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.66,
   "end": 116.44,
   "text": "74 degrees, that's the line"
  },
  {
   "start": 116.44,
   "end": 118.78,
   "text": "Grilled tomato, side by side"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.78,
   "end": 120.94,
   "text": "Fresh green herbs and onions fried"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.94,
   "end": 123.04,
   "text": "Saffron rice, a little butter"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.04,
   "end": 125.26,
   "text": "Persian flavors, nothin' better"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.26,
   "end": 128.6,
   "text": "Sumac, sprinkled lemon, squeezed, eat it hot"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.6,
   "end": 132.24,
   "text": "Enjoy the feast from Persian kitchens to the world"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.24,
   "end": 134.68,
   "text": "Juja kebab, the golden bird"
  },
  {
   "start": 136.84,
   "end": 140.52,
   "text": "Juja, juja, golden chicken, hip hooray"
  },
  {
   "start": 140.52,
   "end": 142.76,
   "text": "Saffron, lemon, charcoal, heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 142.76,
   "end": 145.06,
   "text": "Persian cooking, can't be beat"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.76,
   "end": 149.64,
   "text": "Juja, juja, bring your friends and come this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 149.64,
   "end": 151.86,
   "text": "Rice and butter, herbs so green"
  },
  {
   "start": 151.86,
   "end": 154.04,
   "text": "That's chicken you've ever seen."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.02,
   "end": 159.68,
   "text": "And remember, my friends, saffron is gold."
  },
  {
   "start": 160.38,
   "end": 161.26,
   "text": "Patience is key."
  },
  {
   "start": 161.84,
   "end": 164.66,
   "text": "And never serve raw chicken at your barbecue."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.96,
   "end": 166.96,
   "text": "Georgia kebab!"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.48,
   "end": 169.74,
   "text": "Less Persian magic!"
  }
 ],
